2 12h20M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z"></path></svg></div><p class="text-md leading-relaxed text-ink"><span class="font-semibold text-ink">Multi-Asset<!-- -->.<!-- --> </span>Long or short US100, Gold, or Oil with leverage straight from your wallet. Access global markets without a broker.</p></div><div class="flex gap-5" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(32px)"><div class="mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0 inline-flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-card text-ink bordered"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2"></rect><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"></path></svg></div><p class="text-md leading-relaxed text-ink"><span class="font-semibold text-ink">No Middlemen<!-- -->.<!-- --> </span>You control your assets end-to-end. No brokers, no hidden spreads, no frozen funds. Your keys, your assets.</p></div><div class="flex gap-5" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(32px)"><div class="mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0 inline-flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-card text-ink bordered"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"></path><path d="M12 2L3.09 6.26A2 2 0 0 0 2 8.24v7.63a2 2 0 0 0 1.11 1.79L12 22l8.89-4.34A2 2 0 0 0 22 15.87V8.24a2 2 0 0 0-1.09-1.98L12 2z"></path></svg></div><p class="text-md leading-relaxed text-ink"><span class="font-semibold text-ink">Auditable Design<!-- -->.<!-- --> </span>Track every trade, deposit, and withdrawal through our open, auditable code. Full on-chain transparency.</p></div></div></div><div class="flex items-center justify-center" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(32px)"><div class="relative w-full max-w-sm"><img src="/images/mobile.avif" alt="Ostium mobile app" class="w-full rounded-3xl"/><div class="pointer-events-none absolute bottom-0 left-0 h-1/2 w-full rounded-b-3xl bg-gradient-to-t from-canvas to-transparent"></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-24 px-6"><div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl"><div class="mb-16 text-center" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(32px)"><h2 class="gradient-text-display text-4xl font-normal md:text-5xl">Backed by Leading Investors</h2></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(32px)"><div class="border overflow-hidden border-ink/10"><div class="flex items-center gap-10 border-b p-10 md:p-12 border-ink/10"><div class="flex-1"><p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink/70 md:text-xl">“Ostium is democratizing access to global markets in a way we haven&#x27;t seen before. It&#x27;s a gateway for traders to efficiently capitalize on macro news across traditional financial markets, all with the speed and accessibility of decentralized finance.”         </p><div class="mt-6"><p class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink">Marc Bhargava</p><p class="text-sm text-ink-dim">General Catalyst</p></div></div><div class="hidden flex-shrink-0 md:block"><img src="/logos/vc/marc-bhargava.jpeg" alt="Marc Bhargava" class="h-20 w-20 object-cover"/></div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-3 border-b md:grid-cols-6 divide-x divide-ink/10 border-ink/10"><div class="flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-7"><img src="/logos/vc/gsr.svg" alt="GSR" class="h-5 w-auto logo"/></div><div class="flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-7"><img src="/logos/vc/wintermute.svg" alt="Wintermute Ventures" class="h-5 w-auto logo"/></div><div class="flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-7"><img src="/logos/vc/jump.svg" alt="Jump" class="h-5 w-auto logo"/></div><div class="flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-7"><img src="/logos/vc/gc.svg" alt="General Catalyst" class="h-5 w-auto logo"/></div><div class="flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-7"><img src="/logos/vc/coinbaseventures.svg" alt="Coinbase Ventures" class="h-5 w-auto logo"/></div><div class="flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-7"><img src="/logos/vc/localglobe.svg" alt="LocalGlobe" class="h-5 w-auto logo"/></div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-2 border-b md:grid-cols-4 divide-x divide-ink/10 border-ink/10"><div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-3 px-6 py-8"><img src="/logos/vc/meltem-demirors.jpg" alt="Meltem Demirors" class="h-12 w-12 rounded-full object-cover"/><p class="text-sm text-ink/50 text-center">Meltem Demirors</p></div><div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-3 px-6 py-8"><img src="/logos/vc/balaji-srinivasan.jpg" alt="Balaji Srinivasan" class="h-12 w-12 rounded-full object-cover"/><p class="text-sm text-ink/50 text-center">Balaji Srinivasan</p></div><div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-3 px-6 py-8"><img src="/logos/vc/nick-van-eck.jpg" alt="Nick van Eck" class="h-12 w-12 rounded-full object-cover"/><p class="text-sm text-ink/50 text-center">Nick van Eck</p></div><div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-3 px-6 py-8"><img src="/logos/vc/anteater.jpg" alt="0xAnteater" class="h-12 w-12 rounded-full object-cover"/><p class="text-sm text-ink/50 text-center">0xAnteater</p></div></div><div class="divide-y divide-ink/10"><p class="py-5 text-center text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-ink/25">And angel investors from</p><div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 divide-x divide-ink/10"><div class="flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-7"><img src="/logos/vc/coinbase.svg" alt="Coinbase" class="h-5 w-auto logo"/></div><div class="flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-7"><img src="/logos/vc/paypal.svg" alt="PayPal" class="h-5 w-auto logo"/></div><div class="flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-7"><img src="/logos/vc/brevan-howard.svg" alt="Brevan Howard" class="h-5 w-auto logo"/></div><div class="flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-7"><img src="/logos/vc/bridgewater.svg" alt="Bridgewater" class="h-5 w-auto logo"/></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="relative isolate py-24 px-6 bg-surface/20"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute ins